></ruby>は<ruby>老<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けて<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるが、まだ２０<ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He looks old, but he is still in his twenties.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不幸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不幸；悲哀；灾祸；灾难；事故；（多指亲属的）去世；丧事；丧亲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141265\"><ruby>戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>せんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>恐<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしい<ruby>不幸<rp>(</rp><rt>ふこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こす。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">War causes terrible miseries.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">布告</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふこく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">布告；公告；诏令</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210569\">その<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>隣国<rp>(</rp><rt>りんごく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>対<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>宣戦<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>布告<rp>(</rp><rt>ふこく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The country declared war against its neighbor.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">富豪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">富豪；大富翁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"86922\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>富豪<rp>(</rp><rt>ふごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>結婚<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She will get married to a rich man.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">符号</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">符号；标记；记号；代码；符号（如正负号）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫妻</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夫妻；夫妇；已婚夫妇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84983\"><ruby>夫妻<rp>(</rp><rt>ふさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>化学<rp>(</rp><rt>かがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>近代科学<rp>(</rp><rt>きんだいかがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へと<ruby>一変<rp>(</rp><rt>いっぺん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The couple transformed chemistry into a modern science.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負債</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふさい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">债务；负债</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211361\">その<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>負債<rp>(</rp><rt>ふさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>支払<rp>(</rp><rt>しはら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>充当<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することになっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The money is to be applied to the debt.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塞がる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふさがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关闭；堵塞；愈合（如伤口）；封闭；堵塞；塞住；堵住；被占据；被占用（如住处）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123512\"><ruby>道路<rp>(</rp><rt>どうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>塞<rp>(</rp><rt>ふさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The road is blocked by fallen trees.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">塞ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふさぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">堵住；塞住；封闭；挡住；捂住（耳朵、眼睛等）；闭上（眼睛、嘴巴）；挡住；阻挡；妨碍；占据；填满；占满；尽责；履行职责；充当角色；心情低落；精神不振；闷闷不乐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91847\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなぜかふさいでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She looks blue for some reason.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">相応しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふさわしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰当；适当；合适；相称</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212518\">そのような<ruby>行為<rp>(</rp><rt>こうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>紳士<rp>(</rp><rt>しんし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>相応<rp>(</rp><rt>ふさわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Such conduct does not become a gentleman.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不在</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふざい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缺席；不在；漠视；不理睬</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153476\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>不在<rp>(</rp><rt>ふざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なので<ruby>失望<rp>(</rp><rt>しつぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I was disappointed at her absence.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ふざける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开玩笑；说笑话；戏言；捉弄；嘲笑；作弄；嬉戏；打闹；胡闹；瞎折腾；亲热；调情</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"10906680\">ふざけるにもほどがある！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Even jokes have a limit!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">節</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关节；指节；曲调；旋律；节；茎节；木节；疙瘩；（值得注意的）地方；点；部分；（物理）波节；（驻波的）节点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不思議</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふしぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奇妙；神奇；不可思议；令人惊异；神秘；奇怪的是；说来奇怪；莫名其妙地；出人意料地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120234\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>試合<rp>(</rp><rt>しあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けたことは<ruby>不思議<rp>(</rp><rt>ふしぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is strange that he should have lost the game.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">負傷</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">负伤；受伤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112770\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>負傷<rp>(</rp><rt>ふしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He was injured in the accident.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不審</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怀疑；疑惑；疑问；奇怪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不振</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不景气；萧条；停滞；不活跃；低迷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184073\"><ruby>株式市場<rp>(</rp><rt>かぶしきしじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>不振<rp>(</rp><rt>ふしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The stock market is in a prolonged slump.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">富士山</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふじさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">富士山</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">山</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不順</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふじゅん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不规则；反常；变化无常；不稳定；异常</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">不自由</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふじゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不便；不适；不舒适；贫困；贫乏；缺乏；无能；残疾；障碍；不流利</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夫人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\